    "case_for": "I retain B001. The theory-to-experiment sequence identifies a specific new electronic phase: Kane and Mele's prediction and Molenkamp's material realization. The effect and related phases have since been tested in many systems, supporting the scientific maturity of the achievement. A citation limited to the quantum spin Hall effect can honor that opening without claiming the full topological-insulator field.",
